--- !u!102 &102365773988297632
TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1651560128206891}
  m_Text: "短路环：环内部分产生一个分磁场，该磁场相\n位与环外部分不同。当交变电流过零时，分磁\n场维持铁芯吸合，避免振动。短路环也是交流\n接触器与直流接触器最大的差异"
  m_OffsetZ: 0
  m_CharacterSize: 1
  m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Anchor: 5
  m_Alignment: 0
  m_TabSize: 4
  m_FontSize: 65
  m_FontStyle: 1
  m_RichText: 1
  m_Font: {fileID: 10102, guid: 0000000000000000e000000000000000, type: 0}
  m_Color:
    serializedVersion: 2
    rgba: 4294508799
